carryforwards of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--OperatingLossCarryforwards_iI_c20251231__us-gaap--IncomeTaxAuthorityAxis__us-gaap--StateAndLocalJurisdictionMember_zqCOe4diomNf"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" contextRef="AsOf2025-12-31_us-gaap_StateAndLocalJurisdictionMember" id="Fact000750" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,447,627</ix:nonFraction></span> which will start expiring in 2033.</span></p>

